Scientific and research note:
DarkDNA Observer is an exploratory genomic feature-analysis project. Any "quantum-susceptible" or similarly named feature should be interpreted conservatively as a physical-susceptibility proxy based on sequence composition and context, such as G-richness, G4 potential, oxidation-prone contexts, G-skewness, non-B-DNA propensity, and charge-transfer-like sequence contexts. This project does not claim to demonstrate actual quantum effects in genomic sequences.

